.TH PSDictNext 3 2024-01-03 "PsyC 0.9.4" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSDictNext\fR \- Iterate over the dictionary's next item

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/utils.h>

.I
PSDictItem  *
.br
\fBPSDictNext\fR(\fIPSDictIterator *iterator\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Iterate over the next item using \fIiterator\fR.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The next item (\fIPSDictItem\fR) or \fINULL\fR if there are no more               items to iterate.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
